{title: Brass on Sunday}
{artist: The Quiet Harbour}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
[Eb]Horns in the [Ab]morning, [Bb]bells by the [Eb]noon
[Cm]Everybody [Ab]singing a [Db]borrowed old [Bb]tune
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Ab]Brass on [Bb]Sunday, [Gm]brass on the [Cm]square
[Ab]Brass on [Bb]Sunday, [Eb]brass everywhere
{end_of_chorus}
